notes.content:
Corrections:
- The "Boom stick" recoil does not work on clients;
- Missing notification "No servers found";
- Crookedly flapping the wings;
- The aim disappears at the "Boom stick" after switching to a new map;
- Displayed wrong weapon icons;

Added:
- Weapon "Christmas ornaments";
- Window paper snowflakes decorations;
- Christmas main menu music;

Corrections:
- After leaving the game, it is impossible to join it again;
- When completing the goal "Kill all opponents", the info message "Time ran out" appears;
- Too long character name in the info message "Suicide";
- Disabled the ability "Run with a shield";

Added:
- Completed replacement of the Main Menu;
- Added Pause menu;
- Reworked attack speed, jump height, climbing speed;
- Reduced health from aphids;
- Setting up post-processing on the maps "Alley of dirty dishes", "Temple of the Holy Bread";
- Removed all invisible collisions of death from the maps "Alley of Dirty Dishes", "Temple of Holy Bread";
- Big refactoring, code optimization;
- Temporarily disabled support for the Chinese language;

1) Added:
- game mode Team-DeathMatch;
- clothing "Masks";
- server settings: "Score limit", "Time limit", "Max players", "Wait for all players";
- move to the next map;
2) Bug fixes:
- (Medium)  Delay after throwing one-handed weapon;
- (Medium) Shield can't be activated after pressing the strike button;
- (Medium) Attack delay after climbing;
- (Low) If the exit window is open while respawning, the mouse cursor doesn't disappear;
- (Low) Head animation fix while flying.

1) Added:
- Added the chinese language;
- Added new wing sound;
- Added new one-hand weapon animation;
2) Got rid of cartoon shader;
3) Bug fixes:
- (Urgent) Settings can be applied only when we open "Settings" menu;
- (Medium) A roach can pick up weapons from a distance;
- (Medium) Music tracks don't change;
- (Low) Voice auto-selection system doesn't work when we change language;
- (Low) "Death collision" is located too high in the 1st map;

1) Added:
- Added French language;
- Added hint selection of items;
2) Cosmetic work;
3) Optimization and reworking;
- reworked damage animation calls;
- optimization of data transfer from the client to the server;
- removed the player's name above the "health bar";
- the shield automatically appears in the hand;
- reworked the climbing system;
- added standard font. Players can now write in Chinese;
- Made all sounds voluminous;
4) Corrections:
- (Blocking) Repeated attempts to create a new game session will not be successful;
- (Urgent) Player hit spawner collision;
- (Urgent) Double damage when hit from above;
- (Urgent) When a character is killed, he may not respawn again (floating bug);
- (Medium) "Uppercut" animation was hitting the floor;
- (Medium) Two-handed weapon interrupts when pressing the left mouse button quickly;
- (Low) stepping sound desyncs;
- (Low) Active shield cannot pick up first aid kit;
- (Low) Can climb through textures;
- (Low) Weapons don't disappear after we pick them up (floating bug);
